The MIT license above covers the source code in this repository. It does not
relicense anything this project depends on or was trained on:

- Ultralytics (YOLOv8, RT-DETR), used by src/detect/, is AGPL-3.0. Distributing
  or serving a build that includes it must meet AGPL-3.0 terms, or use an
  Ultralytics enterprise license. The bundled weights yolov8n.pt and
  rtdetr-l.pt are Ultralytics releases under the same terms.
- Datasets keep their own licenses and are never committed (data/raw/ is
  ignored). See reports/license_audit.md: several sources are attribution-only,
  and those with undeclared terms are limited to metrics and models.
- Base language models used in Phase 12 keep their own licenses, which also
  apply to any adapter or merged weights derived from them.
